rtdavix - rewrite #17923721

# Build instructions

Run `make` and pray that you have a good compiler installed (System `gcc`
usually works on a Linux host but a `x86_64-elf-` cross-toolchain is
recommended).

# Instructions for running the kernel

`./run` neatly builds the kernel for you and launches a QEMU virtual machine
from a rescue `.iso`. `./run --help` shows some options that can be passed to
the script.


